              "inline_data": null,
              "text": "To log into your account on **PreLicenseTraining.com** (PLT), choose the portal that matches your account type:\n\n### 1. Student Login\nIf you are a student taking an insurance pre-licensing course, a Continuing Education (CE) course, or using the StudyHall testing center:\n* **Login Link:** [PreLicenseTraining Student Login](https://www.prelicensetraining.com/login)\n* **Tip:** Your username is typically the **email address** you used during registration unless you manually updated it in your profile settings. \n* **Password/Username Recovery:** If you cannot remember your credentials, you can use the **Forgot Password?** or **Forgot Login?** buttons located directly on the login page.\n\n### 2. Mentor / Recruiter / Company Login\nIf you are a manager, recruiter, or mentor tracking student progress, managing custom landing pages, or assigning credits:\n* **Login Link:** [PreLicenseTraining Mentor Portal Login](https://www.prelicensetraining.com/mentor/login)\n* **Password Recovery:** If you are a mentor and need to reset your password, you can use the [Mentor Forgot Password Recovery](https://www.prelicensetraining.com/mentor/forgot-password) page to receive a reset link.\n\n### Troubleshooting Tips\n* **Browser Issues:** If the page isn't loading properly, try clearing your browser\u2019s cache and cookies or opening the page in an incognito/private window.\n* **Customer Support:** If you are locked out of your account or need admin assistance, you can contact PreLicenseTraining support directly at **1 (800) 780-2113**.",
